* DOCFLUSH-20260825-001 E2 guarded HELP refresh.
* Order is contractual: legacy first, current second, readback last.
SET ECHO OFF
STOP_ON_ERROR ON
FORMULA "DOCFLUSH-E2-REFRESH-BEGIN"
ECHO ===== LEGACY HELP BUILD START =====
CMDHELP BUILD LEGACY . D:\code\ccode\src D:\code\ccode\include D:\code\ccode\bindings
ECHO ===== LEGACY HELP BUILD END =====
ECHO ===== CURRENT HELP BUILD START =====
CMDHELP BUILD . D:\code\ccode\src D:\code\ccode\include D:\code\ccode\bindings
ECHO ===== CURRENT HELP BUILD END =====
CMDHELP
CMDHELP LEGACY
CMDHELPCHK
CMDHELPCHK ARTIFACTS . 20
CMDHELPCHK . 20
CMDHELP BUILDVECTORS
CMDHELP BUILDINFO
CMDHELP APPGUI
CMDHELP GUI
CMDHELP SMTP
FORMULA "DOCFLUSH-E2-REFRESH-END"
QUIT
